["<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">祝日</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">しゅくじつ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">国家法定假日；公共假日</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"207335\">その<ruby>日<rp>(</rp><rt>ひ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>国会<rp>(</rp><rt>こっかい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>法令<rp>(</rp><rt>ほうれい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>によって<ruby>祝日<rp>(</rp><rt>しゅくじつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>になった。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">那天是节日 饮食行为。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">宿題</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">しゅくだい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">功课；作业；悬而未决的问题；未解决的课题</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"147882\"><ruby>宿題<rp>(</rp><rt>しゅくだい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はもうやってしまいましたか。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">你完成任务了吗?</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">宿泊</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">しゅくはく</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">住宿；投宿</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"110940\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はホテルに<ruby>電話<rp>(</rp><rt>でんわ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>で<ruby>宿泊<rp>(</rp><rt>しゅくはく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>頼<rp>(</rp><rt>たの</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>んだ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他叫了一家旅馆住。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">宿命</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">しゅくめい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">宿命；命运；天命</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"173533\"><ruby>洪水<rp>(</rp><rt>こうずい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はかつてはこの<ruby>地方<rp>(</rp><rt>ちほう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>には<ruby>宿命<rp>(</rp><rt>しゅくめい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>であった。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">以前,洪水是该地区的命运。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">主権</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">しゅけん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">主权；最高权力；统治权</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"148708\"><ruby>主権<rp>(</rp><rt>しゅけん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>人民<rp>(</rp><rt>じんみん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>にある。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">主权属于人民。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">手芸</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">しゅげい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">手工艺；手工制作</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">主語</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">しゅご</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">主语</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"83694\"><ruby>文<rp>(</rp><rt>ぶん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>には<ruby>普通<rp>(</rp><rt>ふつう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>、<ruby>主語<rp>(</rp><rt>しゅご</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>と<ruby>動詞<rp>(</rp><rt>どうし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>がある。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">判决通常有一个主题和一个动词。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">主催</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">しゅさい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">主办；举办；承办；组织</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">取材</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">しゅざい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">采访；采集素材；收集资料；报道；新闻采访</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"213053\">そのジャーナリストは<ruby>自分<rp>(</rp><rt>じぶん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>取材<rp>(</rp><rt>しゅざい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>した<ruby>事実<rp>(</rp><rt>じじつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>勝手<rp>(</rp><rt>かって</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>変<rp>(</rp><rt>か</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>えた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">这名记者带着他收集的事实自由了。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">趣旨</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">しゅし</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">宗旨；主旨</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\"><ruby>会<rp>(</rp><rt>かい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>趣旨<rp>(</rp><rt>しゅし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>賛同<rp>(</rp><rt>さんどう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>して<ruby>入会<rp>(</rp><rt>にゅうかい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>した。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">赞同该会的宗旨而入会。</span><span class=\"lx-src\"><span class=\"t-zh\">汉字 </span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">漢字 </span><a href=\"../n1/kanji/\" lang=\"ja\">趣</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">首相</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">しゅしょう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">首相；总理；（德国、奥地利等国的）总理</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"148416\"><ruby>首相<rp>(</rp><rt>しゅしょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>留守中<rp>(</rp><rt>るすちゅう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>外務大臣<rp>(</rp><rt>がいむだいじん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>代理<rp>(</rp><rt>だいり</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>務<rp>(</rp><rt>つと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>める。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">外交部长将在总理不在时代行总理职务。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">主食</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">しゅしょく</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">主食</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"122232\"><ruby>日本人<rp>(</rp><rt>にほんじん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>米<rp>(</rp><rt>こめ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>と<ruby>魚<rp>(</rp><rt>さかな</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>主食<rp>(</rp><rt>しゅしょく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>にしています。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">日本人以米饭和鱼为生存之食。 <a class=\"ex-attribution\" href=\"https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/2333772\" title=\"Tatoeba · anndiana\" aria-label=\"Tatoeba · anndiana\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">↗</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">手術</span><s