"160869\"><ruby>私<rp>(</rp><rt>わたし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はこの<ruby>主題<rp>(</rp><rt>しゅだい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>精通<rp>(</rp><rt>せいつう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>している。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我熟悉这个问题。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">手段</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">しゅだん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">手段；方式；办法</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"170798\"><ruby>最<rp>(</rp><rt>もっと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>も<ruby>急<rp>(</rp><rt>いそ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いで<ruby>旅行<rp>(</rp><rt>りょこう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>する<ruby>手段<rp>(</rp><rt>しゅだん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>飛行機<rp>(</rp><rt>ひこうき</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>だ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">最快的旅行方式是坐飞机。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">主張</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">しゅちょう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">主张；坚持；断言；倡导；强调；争辩；观点；主义</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"166383\"><ruby>私<rp>(</rp><rt>わたし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>たちはその<ruby>重要性<rp>(</rp><rt>じゅうようせい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>主張<rp>(</rp><rt>しゅちょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>した。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我们坚持其重要性。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">出勤</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">しゅっきん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">上班；出勤；到岗；报到</span>